    <string name="pysanka__ai__how_to_use">Tap ✦ on the bar above the keyboard: the AI assistant opens in place of the keys for the selected text (or the whole field): grammar, style, summary, translation, replies to the message on the clipboard and more. “Expand” opens the full editor. The AI never works in password fields or incognito.</string>
